	(text "Controller board, unit 1 (architecture rev C, D-51, D-55 to D-58). Stacked above the RF board; J2 plugs onto RF board J14.\nRJ45 LINK on the top wall: Cat6 #1 to the shack, T568B, four opto current loops (L1 data in, L2 PTT, L3 SAFE, L4 data out).\nSafety gate on the MCU sheet (D-59): supervisor with watchdog, fault latch and NOR gate drive RLY_EN (J2 pin 7).\nRLY_EN has its 100k pull-down on the RF board: without the controller board all relays stay off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
